{
  "metadata": { "name": "Option Strategies", "language_info": { "name": "JavaScipt", "version": "8.0" } },
  "jsnbversion": "v0.1",
  "cells": [
    { "code": "# Voltrix Tests — `/options/strategies`\n", "status": "", "output": "<h1>Voltrix Tests — <code>/options/strategies</code></h1>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "const BASE = 'http://localhost:8000/v2';\n\nasync function post(path, body) {\n  const res = await fetch(`${BASE}${path}`, {\n    method: 'POST',\n    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n    body: JSON.stringify(body),\n  });\n  return res.json();\n}\n\nfunction showStrategy(r) {\n  scrib.show('Strategy:   ' + r.strategy);\n  scrib.show('Max Profit: ' + (r.max_profit === null ? 'unlimited' : r.max_profit));\n  scrib.show('Max Loss:   ' + (r.max_loss   === null ? 'unlimited' : r.max_loss));\n  scrib.show('Breakevens: ' + r.breakevens.join(', '));\n  scrib.show('Payoff sample (spot → P&L):');\n  r.payoff.filter((_, i) => i % 4 === 0).forEach(p => scrib.show('  ' + p.spot.toFixed(1) + ' → ' + p.value.toFixed(2)));\n}", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 1. Bull Call Spread — Interactive\n\nBuy a lower-strike call, sell a higher-strike call. Capped profit, capped loss.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>1. Bull Call Spread — Interactive</h2>\n<p>Buy a lower-strike call, sell a higher-strike call. Capped profit, capped loss.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "//>html\n<div>\n  <label>Spot <input id='bcs-spot' type='number' value='100'></label>\n  <label>Settlement Date <input id='bcs-settle' type='date' value='2026-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Expiry Date <input id='bcs-expiry' type='date' value='2027-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Long Call Strike <input id='bcs-k1' type='number' value='100'></label>\n  <label>Long Call Premium <input id='bcs-p1' type='number' value='10' step='0.5'></label>\n  <label>Short Call Strike <input id='bcs-k2' type='number' value='110'></label>\n  <label>Short Call Premium <input id='bcs-p2' type='number' value='5' step='0.5'></label>\n</div>", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "const result = await post('/options/strategies', {\n  spot:            parseFloat(document.getElementById('bcs-spot').value),\n  settlement_date: document.getElementById('bcs-settle').value,\n  legs: [\n    { type: 'call', position: 'long',  strike: parseFloat(document.getElementById('bcs-k1').value), expiry_date: document.getElementById('bcs-expiry').value, premium: parseFloat(document.getElementById('bcs-p1').value) },\n    { type: 'call', position: 'short', strike: parseFloat(document.getElementById('bcs-k2').value), expiry_date: document.getElementById('bcs-expiry').value, premium: parseFloat(document.getElementById('bcs-p2').value) },\n  ],\n});\nshowStrategy(result);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 2. Bear Put Spread — Interactive\n\nBuy a higher-strike put, sell a lower-strike put. Profits when spot falls.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>2. Bear Put Spread — Interactive</h2>\n<p>Buy a higher-strike put, sell a lower-strike put. Profits when spot falls.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "//>html\n<div>\n  <label>Spot <input id='bps-spot' type='number' value='100'></label>\n  <label>Settlement Date <input id='bps-settle' type='date' value='2026-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Expiry Date <input id='bps-expiry' type='date' value='2027-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Long Put Strike <input id='bps-k1' type='number' value='110'></label>\n  <label>Long Put Premium <input id='bps-p1' type='number' value='12' step='0.5'></label>\n  <label>Short Put Strike <input id='bps-k2' type='number' value='100'></label>\n  <label>Short Put Premium <input id='bps-p2' type='number' value='7' step='0.5'></label>\n</div>", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "const result = await post('/options/strategies', {\n  spot:            parseFloat(document.getElementById('bps-spot').value),\n  settlement_date: document.getElementById('bps-settle').value,\n  legs: [\n    { type: 'put', position: 'long',  strike: parseFloat(document.getElementById('bps-k1').value), expiry_date: document.getElementById('bps-expiry').value, premium: parseFloat(document.getElementById('bps-p1').value) },\n    { type: 'put', position: 'short', strike: parseFloat(document.getElementById('bps-k2').value), expiry_date: document.getElementById('bps-expiry').value, premium: parseFloat(document.getElementById('bps-p2').value) },\n  ],\n});\nshowStrategy(result);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 3. Long Straddle\n\nBuy both a call and put at the same strike. Profits from large moves in either direction.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>3. Long Straddle</h2>\n<p>Buy both a call and put at the same strike. Profits from large moves in either direction.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "//>html\n<div>\n  <label>Spot <input id='str-spot' type='number' value='100'></label>\n  <label>Strike <input id='str-k' type='number' value='100'></label>\n  <label>Settlement Date <input id='str-settle' type='date' value='2026-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Expiry Date <input id='str-expiry' type='date' value='2027-01-01'></label>\n  <label>Call Premium <input id='str-cp' type='number' value='10' step='0.5'></label>\n  <label>Put Premium <input id='str-pp' type='number' value='8' step='0.5'></label>\n</div>", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "const K      = parseFloat(document.getElementById('str-k').value);\nconst expiry = document.getElementById('str-expiry').value;\nconst result = await post('/options/strategies', {\n  spot:            parseFloat(document.getElementById('str-spot').value),\n  settlement_date: document.getElementById('str-settle').value,\n  legs: [\n    { type: 'call', position: 'long', strike: K, expiry_date: expiry, premium: parseFloat(document.getElementById('str-cp').value) },\n    { type: 'put',  position: 'long', strike: K, expiry_date: expiry, premium: parseFloat(document.getElementById('str-pp').value) },\n  ],\n});\nshowStrategy(result);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 4. Iron Condor\n\nSell an OTM call spread and an OTM put spread. Profits in low-volatility, range-bound markets.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>4. Iron Condor</h2>\n<p>Sell an OTM call spread and an OTM put spread. Profits in low-volatility, range-bound markets.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "const result = await post('/options/strategies', {\n  spot: 100,\n  settlement_date: '2026-01-01',\n  legs: [\n    { type: 'put',  position: 'long',  strike: 85,  expiry_date: '2027-01-01', premium: 2 },\n    { type: 'put',  position: 'short', strike: 90,  expiry_date: '2027-01-01', premium: 4 },\n    { type: 'call', position: 'short', strike: 110, expiry_date: '2027-01-01', premium: 4 },\n    { type: 'call', position: 'long',  strike: 115, expiry_date: '2027-01-01', premium: 2 },\n  ],\n});\nshowStrategy(result);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" },
    { "code": "---\n\n## 5. Butterfly Spread\n\nBuy 1 low call, sell 2 middle calls, buy 1 high call. Low-vol strategy with limited risk.\n", "status": "", "output": "<hr>\n<h2>5. Butterfly Spread</h2>\n<p>Buy 1 low call, sell 2 middle calls, buy 1 high call. Low-vol strategy with limited risk.</p>\n", "type": "html" },
    { "code": "const result = await post('/options/strategies', {\n  spot: 100,\n  settlement_date: '2026-01-01',\n  legs: [\n    { type: 'call', position: 'long',  strike: 90,  expiry_date: '2027-01-01', premium: 15 },\n    { type: 'call', position: 'short', strike: 100, expiry_date: '2027-01-01', premium: 10 },\n    { type: 'call', position: 'short', strike: 100, expiry_date: '2027-01-01', premium: 10 },\n    { type: 'call', position: 'long',  strike: 110, expiry_date: '2027-01-01', premium: 6  },\n  ],\n});\nshowStrategy(result);", "status": "", "output": "", "type": "code" }
  ],
  "source": "https://github.com/gopi-suvanam/scribbler",
  "run_on_load": false
}
